{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro]\n[00:11.90](Gezin)\n[Chorus]\n[00:13.50]Never have you waiting, baby, I'll be on time\n[00:16.66]Crazy how you the one on top of these mountains I climb\n[00:19.70]Lately, I been over anxious, you make it all right\n[00:23.04]I've never felt a love like this, first time in my life\n[00:26.80]Whenever I'm in a crisis, you stand by my side\n[00:30.22]And ride, you're so righteous\n[00:31.88]You hate it when I get high, so high I look lifeless\n[00:35.24]Yeah, it is what it is, but whatever it is, it's all the way 'til the end\n[Verse 1]\n[00:41.40]You're so good at readin' my mind\n[00:44.78]Oh, how I love spending time, time, time\n[00:57.78]I, I hit the ground sometimes\n[01:02.08]But it's alright 'cause we all have a downside\n[01:09.92]All I had was a glimpse\n[01:10.98]Lost in a maze in my mind all the time\n[01:12.34]So many demons inside of me, shit don't make sense\n[01:14.20]When you wake up in hell while you laying in your bed\n[01:15.82]Wonder how the fuck did I get here or when? (Uhm)\n[01:17.98]I'm questioning everything again\n[01:19.70]Hold her tight, won't let go of her hand\n[Chorus]\n[01:21.24]Never have you waiting, baby, I'll be on time\n[01:24.02]Crazy how you the one on top of these mountains I climb\n[01:28.70]Lately, I been over anxious, you make it all right\n[01:34.40]I've never felt a love like this, first time in my life\n[01:36.32]Whenever I'm in a crisis, you stand by my side\n[01:38.02]And ride, you're so righteous\n[01:39.30]You hate it when I get high, so high I look lifeless\n[01:42.70]Yeah, it is what it is, but whatever it is, it's all the way 'til the end\n[Verse 2]\n[01:48.52]Got an angel with me while I'm running through these hell pits\n[01:51.90]Me and her can share the world and end up being selfish, uh\n[01:55.68]Pretty as hell, feel her like braille, Cupid nailed it\n[01:58.62]She my umbrella when the rain storms hit\n[02:02.02]Some days high tides, some black skies\n[02:05.44]Demons 